         StateHolderModel built by AppContainer from the KMP drives StateFlow;
         tests/previews = InMemoryDriveEfficiencySource).
  useUnits.distance ('mi'|'km')                      → DriveEfficiencyDistanceUnit
  useDateFormat.formatDateShort                      → model labelFormatter (UTC MMM d)
  useThemeChartPalette                               → TSChartPalette / TSChartGradient

Logic ported 1:1 (DriveEfficiencyProjection, executed in [B]):
  estimateEfficiency → estimateWhPerKilometer ; buildDailyEfficiency →
  buildDailyKilometerBased ; 30-day filter + display conversion + Avg/Best/Trend
  → make() ; fmtNumber(x,0)/trend% → integerString/trendString.

States (every one renders — no hidden surfaces):
  loading  → skeleton stat row + TSChartSkeleton           (presentation == .loading)
  empty    → TSEmptyState "No efficiency data yet"          (.empty; raw or projected)
  error    → icon + translation.error.loadFailed + Retry    (.error; failed, no cache)
  stale    → content + TSFreshnessIndicator(stale)          (freshnessChip == .stale)
  offline  → content (cached) + TSBadge offline             (freshnessChip == .offline)
  content  → stats + area/line/rolling/avg chart + legend   (.content) + Updated chip
  background-error (failed w/ cache) → content + inline retry callout
  compact (≤1×1) → stat-only layout, corner freshness overlay (web isCompact branch)

